{"id":88,"name":"الغاشية","transliteration":"Al-Ghashiyah","translation_fr":"L'enveloppante","translation_en":"The Overwhelming","type":"meccan","total_verses":26,"verses":[{"id":1,"text":"هَلۡ أَتَىٰكَ حَدِيثُ ٱلۡغَٰشِيَةِ","translation_fr":"T'est-il parvenu le récit de l'enveloppante","translation_en":"Has there reached you the report of the Overwhelming [event]","transliteration":"Hal ataka hadeethu alghashiyati"},{"id":2,"text":"وُجُوهٞ يَوۡمَئِذٍ خَٰشِعَةٌ","translation_fr":"Ce jour-là, il y aura des visages humiliés","translation_en":"[Some] faces, that Day, will be humbled","transliteration":"Wujoohun yawmaithin khashiAAatun"},{"id":3,"text":"عَامِلَةٞ نَّاصِبَةٞ","translation_fr":"préoccupés, harassés","translation_en":"Working [hard] and exhausted","transliteration":"AAamilatun nasibatun"},{"id":4,"text":"تَصۡلَىٰ نَارًا حَامِيَةٗ","translation_fr":"Ils brûleront dans un Feu ardent","translation_en":"They will [enter to] burn in an intensely hot Fire","transliteration":"Tasla naran hamiyatan"},{"id":5,"text":"تُسۡقَىٰ مِنۡ عَيۡنٍ ءَانِيَةٖ","translation_fr":"et seront abreuvés d'une source bouillante","translation_en":"They will be given drink from a boiling spring","transliteration":"Tusqa min AAaynin aniyatin"},{"id":6,"text":"لَّيۡسَ لَهُمۡ طَعَامٌ إِلَّا مِن ضَرِيعٖ","translation_fr":"Il n'y aura pour eux d'autre nourriture que des plantes épineuses [darî]","translation_en":"For them there will be no food except from a poisonous, thorny plant","transliteration":"Laysa lahum taAAamun illa min dareeAAin"},{"id":7,"text":"لَّا يُسۡمِنُ وَلَا يُغۡنِي مِن جُوعٖ","translation_fr":"qui n'engraisse, ni n'apaise la faim","translation_en":"Which neither nourishes nor avails against hunger","transliteration":"La yusminu wala yughnee min jooAAin"},{"id":8,"text":"وُجُوهٞ يَوۡمَئِذٖ نَّاعِمَةٞ","translation_fr":"Ce jour-là, il y aura des visages épanouis","translation_en":"[Other] faces, that Day, will show pleasure","transliteration":"Wujoohun yawmaithin naAAimatun"},{"id":9,"text":"لِّسَعۡيِهَا رَاضِيَةٞ","translation_fr":"contents de leurs efforts","translation_en":"With their effort [they are] satisfied","transliteration":"LisaAAyiha radiyatun"},{"id":10,"text":"فِي جَنَّةٍ عَالِيَةٖ","translation_fr":"dans un haut Jardin","translation_en":"In an elevated garden","transliteration":"Fee jannatin AAaliyatin"},{"id":11,"text":"لَّا تَسۡمَعُ فِيهَا لَٰغِيَةٗ","translation_fr":"où ils n'entendent aucune futilité","translation_en":"Wherein they will hear no unsuitable speech","transliteration":"La tasmaAAu feeha laghiyatan"},{"id":12,"text":"فِيهَا عَيۡنٞ جَارِيَةٞ","translation_fr":"Là, il y aura une source coulante","translation_en":"Within it is a flowing spring","transliteration":"Feeha AAaynun jariyatun"},{"id":13,"text":"فِيهَا سُرُرٞ مَّرۡفُوعَةٞ","translation_fr":"Là, des divans élevés","translation_en":"Within it are couches raised high","transliteration":"Feeha sururun marfooAAatun"},{"id":14,"text":"وَأَكۡوَابٞ مَّوۡضُوعَةٞ","translation_fr":"et des coupes posées","translation_en":"And cups put in place","transliteration":"Waakwabun mawdooAAatun"},{"id":15,"text":"وَنَمَارِقُ مَصۡفُوفَةٞ","translation_fr":"et des coussins rangés","translation_en":"And cushions lined up","transliteration":"Wanamariqu masfoofatun"},{"id":16,"text":"وَزَرَابِيُّ مَبۡثُوثَةٌ","translation_fr":"et des tapis étalés","translation_en":"And carpets spread around","transliteration":"Wazarabiyyu mabthoothatun"},{"id":17,"text":"أَفَلَا يَنظُرُونَ إِلَى ٱلۡإِبِلِ كَيۡفَ خُلِقَتۡ","translation_fr":"Ne considèrent-ils donc pas les chameaux, comment ils ont été créés","translation_en":"Then do they not look at the camels - how they are created","transliteration":"Afala yanthuroona ila alibili kayfa khuliqat"},{"id":18,"text":"وَإِلَى ٱلسَّمَآءِ كَيۡفَ رُفِعَتۡ","translation_fr":"et le ciel comment il est élevé","translation_en":"And at the sky - how it is raised","transliteration":"Waila alssamai kayfa rufiAAat"},{"id":19,"text":"وَإِلَى ٱلۡجِبَالِ كَيۡفَ نُصِبَتۡ","translation_fr":"et les montagnes comment elles sont dressées","translation_en":"And at the mountains - how they are erected","transliteration":"Waila aljibali kayfa nusibat"},{"id":20,"text":"وَإِلَى ٱلۡأَرۡضِ كَيۡفَ سُطِحَتۡ","translation_fr":"et la terre comment elle est nivelée","translation_en":"And at the earth - how it is spread out","transliteration":"Waila alardi kayfa sutihat"},{"id":21,"text":"فَذَكِّرۡ إِنَّمَآ أَنتَ مُذَكِّرٞ","translation_fr":"Eh bien, rappelle! Tu n'es qu'un rappeleur","translation_en":"So remind, [O Muhammad]; you are only a reminder","transliteration":"Fathakkir innama anta muthakkirun"},{"id":22,"text":"لَّسۡتَ عَلَيۡهِم بِمُصَيۡطِرٍ","translation_fr":"et tu n'es pas un dominateur sur eux","translation_en":"You are not over them a controller","transliteration":"Lasta AAalayhim bimusaytirin"},{"id":23,"text":"إِلَّا مَن تَوَلَّىٰ وَكَفَرَ","translation_fr":"Sauf celui qui tourne le dos et ne croit pas","translation_en":"However, he who turns away and disbelieves","transliteration":"Illa man tawalla wakafara"},{"id":24,"text":"فَيُعَذِّبُهُ ٱللَّهُ ٱلۡعَذَابَ ٱلۡأَكۡبَرَ","translation_fr":"alors Allah le châtiera du plus grand châtiment","translation_en":"Then Allah will punish him with the greatest punishment","transliteration":"FayuAAaththibuhu Allahu alAAathaba alakbara"},{"id":25,"text":"إِنَّ إِلَيۡنَآ إِيَابَهُمۡ","translation_fr":"Vers Nous est leur retour","translation_en":"Indeed, to Us is their return","transliteration":"Inna ilayna iyabahum"},{"id":26,"text":"ثُمَّ إِنَّ عَلَيۡنَا حِسَابَهُم","translation_fr":"Ensuite, c'est à Nous de leur demander compte","translation_en":"Then indeed, upon Us is their account","transliteration":"Thumma inna AAalayna hisabahum"}]}